  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- Local CalendarEvents collections on PersianCalendar, PersianDatePicker, PersianDateTimePicker and PersianCalendarWithClock.\n- XAML initialization and MVVM binding support.\n- Automatic display updates when events are added, removed or edited.\n\nImproved:\n- Combine local events with provider occurrences, giving local events precedence for matching dates and IDs.\n- Reuse cached provider results during local edits.\n- Honor shared tooltip templates for metadata entries without a per-day template, including changes while event display is disabled.\n- Update documentation with simpler event examples and unified DayMetadata guidance.\n\nDeprecated:\n- DayToolTips and DayIndicators now issue non-error Obsolete warnings. Use DayMetadata instead. Existing APIs remain available.\n\nCompatibility:\n- ShowCalendarEvents still defaults to false.\n- Existing provider and recurrence APIs remain supported.\n- DayToolTipTemplate and DayIndicatorStyle remain supported.\n- Projects treating warnings as errors should migrate deprecated usages before updating.\n\nfix:Display highlight  border in default theme",
